de of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-2,0)}=3(-2)^{2}-3(0)=12, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-1,-1)}=3(-1)^{2}-3(-1)=6, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-1,3)}=3(-1)^{2}-3(3)=-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following diagram.\n\n![](images/b9/b91833eba8558d82b86f66bbc5889f2a6bb2187178170846c12238a3027cd2a0.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186670675 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "123e4d64-73d1-5418-876b-e5811c5c14d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e1/e1a05ebab1bd4eeba5fc91126badf4600fed0cb7e6fc19b848d91e06664f3b1c.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186670663} {:answer/id #uuid "1532a0cc-56c3-55b3-9723-046ecc0679fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/dd/dde7cf2388af8e602ca6308eeedd2560dc09e1a6062166ce3cef4f69d62d0643.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186670665} {:answer/id #uuid "52188b34-0248-5085-a960-b7d7eec72d11" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/42/42df4bf8c25e644e5ddfc47623e2e7a391d897ed8ceeb72b429f0b29e5fca2f1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186670677} {:answer/id #uuid "614f69c6-32c6-597d-b91d-125f3574b8d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/da/da38e55a37f775b3e531b61436ff070901cd88f7ce4a7c9229f096e87159c3c8.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186670680} {:answer/id #uuid "69b99694-a609-53a7-b152-6496f8a3e0b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/0e/0ee119f4b38461acc0fdb9e529e7e7b53f74c7ead8097e82adcf5fabf1247ede.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186670682}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "614f69c6-32c6-597d-b91d-125f3574b8d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/valu